    <!-- Onboarding. One question per screen (DESIGN.md). Every "why" line exists because a
         student deserves to know what an answer is used for before giving it. -->
    <string name="onb_welcome_title">Every gate between you and your goal, before it is too late</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body">Tell us where you are today and what you want to become. We show the exams, age limits, physical standards and deadlines on the way, each with the official source it came from.</string>
